{"architectures":["x64"],"id":"guoyongchang.WorktreeManager","latestVersion":"0.20261012.110304","media":{"icons":[{"mimeType":"image/png","path":"media/icon.31de6f44.png","priority":1,"sha256":"31de6f4474e5da4dbe1cb72bf0bae2a7983adb48b9fedfaa9f020d47102de7d3","source":"winget-legacy"}],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"一个优雅的 Git Worktree 可视化管理工具","license":"免费软件","locale":"zh-CN","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"An elegant Git Worktree managemer with visualization","license":"Freeware","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"Git Worktree Manager is built on Git's native worktree capability, allowing you to check out multiple branches into separate directories in the same repository while sharing the same .git data. With automatic symlinking for large folders such as node_modules, it enables zero-cost branch switching and requires no additional disk space.\n\nCore Features\n- Parallel Work on Multiple Branches\n  Work on multiple branches of the same project simultaneously without mutual interference. No need to stash changes, no need to clone multiple copies of the repository.\n- Smart Folder Linking\n  Automatically links build artifacts such as node_modules, .next, and vendor when creating a worktree to avoid repeated dependency installation. Custom link paths are supported.\n- Global Workspace File Sharing\n  Files including .claude, CLAUDE.md, requirement-docs can be configured as global links to be shared across all worktrees.\n- Branch Status at a Glance\n  Displays real-time information for each branch, including commit count, uncommitted changes, whether it has been merged into the test branch, and more.\n- Quick IDE Launch\n  Open any worktree with VS Code, Cursor or IntelliJ IDEA in one click.\n- Built-in Terminal\n  Each worktree has an independent terminal session, eliminating the need to switch between multiple windows.\n- Secure Archiving\n  Archive the worktree after development is completed. Uncommitted and unpushed code is automatically checked before archiving to prevent data loss.","tags":["branch","code","coding","develop","development","git","vcs","worktree"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"一个优雅的 Git Worktree 可视化管理工具","license":"免费软件","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"Git Worktree Manager 基于 Git 原生的 worktree 能力构建，让你在同一个仓库中同时检出多个分支到独立目录，共享 .git 数据。配合自动 symlink node_modules 等大文件夹，零成本切换，零额外磁盘占用。\n\n核心功能\n- 多分支并行工作\n  一个项目同时打开多个分支，互不干扰。不用 stash，不用 clone 多份。\n- 智能文件夹链接\n  创建 worktree 时自动链接 node_modules、.next、vendor 等构建产物，避免重复安装依赖。支持自定义链接路径。\n- Workspace 全局文件共享\n  .claude、CLAUDE.md、requirement-docs 等文件可以配置为全局链接，在所有 worktree 中共享。\n- 分支状态一目了然\n  实时显示每个分支的提交数、未提交更改、是否合并到测试分支等信息。\n- 快速打开 IDE\n  一键用 VS Code、Cursor 或 IntelliJ IDEA 打开任意 worktree。\n- 内置终端\n  每个 worktree 有独立的终端会话，无需在多个窗口之间切换。\n- 安全归档\n  完成开发后归档 worktree，归档前自动检查未提交和未推送的代码，防止丢失。","name":"Worktree Manager","packageUrl":"https://github.com/guoyongchang/worktree-manager","publisher":"Worktree Manager Team","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/guoyongchang","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/guoyongchang/worktree-manager/releases/tag/v0.20261012.110304","tags":["git","worktree","代码","分支","开发","版本控制"]}},"longDescription":"Git Worktree Manager 基于 Git 原生的 worktree 能力构建，让你在同一个仓库中同时检出多个分支到独立目录，共享 .git 数据。配合自动 symlink node_modules 等大文件夹，零成本切换，零额外磁盘占用。\n\n核心功能\n- 多分支并行工作\n  一个项目同时打开多个分支，互不干扰。不用 stash，不用 clone 多份。\n- 智能文件夹链接\n  创建 worktree 时自动链接 node_modules、.next、vendor 等构建产物，避免重复安装依赖。支持自定义链接路径。\n- Workspace 全局文件共享\n  .claude、CLAUDE.md、requirement-docs 等文件可以配置为全局链接，在所有 worktree 中共享。\n- 分支状态一目了然\n  实时显示每个分支的提交数、未提交更改、是否合并到测试分支等信息。\n- 快速打开 IDE\n  一键用 VS Code、Cursor 或 IntelliJ IDEA 打开任意 worktree。\n- 内置终端\n  每个 worktree 有独立的终端会话，无需在多个窗口之间切换。\n- 安全归档\n  完成开发后归档 worktree，归档前自动检查未提交和未推送的代码，防止丢失。","name":"Worktree Manager","packageUrl":"https://github.com/guoyongchang/worktree-manager","publisher":"Worktree Manager Team","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/guoyongchang","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/guoyongchang/worktree-manager/releases/tag/v0.20261012.110304","tags":["git","worktree","代码","分支","开发","版本控制"]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.20261012.110304/app.json","detailSha256":"e5d0a7f1faa852c71abc29bf2d2b52b396038256e46e971c8eeb52de92d594a4","releaseDate":"2026-10-12","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"0.20261012.110304"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.20260923.52626/app.json","detailSha256":"b47603e7d4bf8c31caec0b8d7a0a0e56497ec613d13deda195bce78c4ef29bff","releaseDate":"2026-09-23","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"0.20260923.52626"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.20260903.20439/app.json","detailSha256":"86ebeefccc899a52e7e91d91ba1a070219fe9139f5174297b818032fbb403a21","releaseDate":"2026-09-03","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"0.20260903.20439"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.20260707.52246/app.json","detailSha256":"04b79173b612000c9e04a0fe2503fa3200af7e427af731c2ad5f6b740d92121f","releaseDate":"2026-07-07","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"0.20260707.52246"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.20260706.143603/app.json","detailSha256":"61091a91325c00a8d529d2b6147a01c672fe913743f740372b6a1cae173ca95f","releaseDate":"2026-07-06","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"0.20260706.143603"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.20260705.155953/app.json","detailSha256":"6c492bff47f649e1c0b276943f5ec9e18b6503150fcbaad38450a02a66fb4483","releaseDate":"2026-07-05","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"0.20260705.155953"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.20260705.2431/app.json","detailSha256":"747f46b2e4a2367ff899fa6b344961cf035298380f41f1a0571088734d185111","releaseDate":"2026-07-05","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"0.20260705.2431"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.20260616.144458/app.json","detailSha256":"1c371e8edac9b4156df4ea33ea6389596b2960f3e5a611284aa7a9da52cf8dc4","releaseDate":"2026-0